From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: UCSIG <65302813+UCSIG@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Dec 2024 18:31:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Increase HCI_RX_BUF_QUEUE_SIZE from 8 to 16

With the default queue size of 8, every BLE OTA update (Nordic Legacy
DFU) to the Seeed XIAO nRF52840 failed. Raising the HCI RX buffer queue
to 16 fixes it.

See https://github.com/adafruit/Adafruit_nRF52_Bootloader/issues/306
---
 src/sdk_config.h | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/sdk_config.h b/src/sdk_config.h
index 50e8196..4e55b17 100644
--- a/src/sdk_config.h
+++ b/src/sdk_config.h
@@ -66,7 +66,7 @@
 #define HCI_MEM_POOL_ENABLED               1
 #define HCI_TX_BUF_SIZE                    600 // not used
 #define HCI_RX_BUF_SIZE                    600
-#define HCI_RX_BUF_QUEUE_SIZE              8   // must be power of 2
+#define HCI_RX_BUF_QUEUE_SIZE              16   // must be power of 2
 
 //==========================================================
 // <e> UART_ENABLED - nrf_drv_uart - UART/UARTE peripheral driver
